# 01r,22sep92,jcf  added dataSegPad.o in the right places.
#		   changed vxWorks_rom to run at RAM_LOW_ADRS.
# 01q,16sep92,gae  moved 'docs' rule to first pass.
# 01p,11sep92,gae  added 'docs' rule; removed old doc & tags stuff.
# 01o,04sep92,yp   moved man rule to makeTarget1
# 01n,04sep92,yp   changed save rule to use wild card
# 01m,01sep92,yp   took out forced build of 01j. activated save rule.
#		   added documentation rule
# 01l,17aug92,yp   added CPU and TOOL to release rule
# 01k,13aug92,yp   changed release rule so we can over ride from MakeSkel
# 01j,13aug92,jcf  forced build of ../all/*.c; added $(LIB) to depedencies.
# 01i,02aug92,yp   changed title line.
# 01h,02aug92,yp   returned archiving rules to src directories;
#		   removed libraries from dependency list
# 01g,27jul92,rrr  made release programable (and also not do the save)
# 01f,21jul92,rdc  moved MACH_DEP to make.defaults, added dataSegPad.o rules.
# 01e,21jul92,rrr  added rules for save, restore, release, and clean
# 01d,17jul92,rrr  added removal of tmp files.
